  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environmental Protection Agency, Office of Air and Radiation (OAR), Global Methane Initiative (GMI) and Climate and Clean Air Coalition (CCAC) support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This funding will provide subject matter expertise, technical assistance, and in-country sub-contractor support to assist EPA in providing technical cooperation and assistance through the Global Methane Initiative and the Climate and Clean Air Coalition. Focus of assistance is to mitigate methane emissions from the municipal solid waste and agricultural sectors and encourage use of biogas for clean energy generation.</narrative>
  </description>
